= Kristina Sharashidze

Kristina Sharashidze is a Georgian Social-Democrat, teacher, and member of the Duma.

- @readmfr
- @campaign_welfare
- @solidarist_urgency
- @root: Return to main

@readmfr
title: Fund Social-Democratic Literacy Programs.
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: We do not have the money.
on-arrival: budget -= 1; workers_rsdrp += 5*(1-dissent); rural_rsdrp += 3*(1-dissent); unemployed -= 0.2 if unemployed >= 4; literacy_rate += 3

We have increased funding for party-sponsored literacy programs.

@campaign_welfare
title: Rally in favor of Trudopolit.
subtitle: Campaign for food, welfare, and education.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6;
go-to: rally.welfare


@solidarist_urgency
title: Warning about the Solidarists
subtitle: A life-long advocate against autocracy, Sharashidze can warn the party about the rising threat that is Solidarism.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; nazi_urgency += 1; rb_militancy += 0.01; nts_workers -= 4*(1-dissent);

We have begun a propaganda campaign to warn our members away from the Solidarism.
